Z||000000||Haze_Performance||06-19-2000||05:07 AM||||Well all the talk about the free book and GM key, I just had to go see if I could get one. The cool thing is I first asked for a price for carb gasket. Before I could ask for the book & key she just handed it to me. SOOOOO COOL.  ||||reg||12
Z||000001||BroCar 87||06-19-2000||05:33 PM||||free book and GM key?? whats that?||||reg||1
Z||000002||BAM-BAM||06-19-2000||05:45 PM||||   That's the little shorting key that you use to read your ECM error codes. The book is an instruction booklet that tells you how to use the key and what the error codes mean. it's pretty easy to do and could save you lots of $$$$. <P> Late BAM OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
