Z||000004||Gokart||06-19-2000||09:54 PM||||Without the key and book Autozone still rules! They have the parts I need almost always and/or get them quickly and they are friendly and eager to help! I know them all by first name now and when their not too busy they usually already have my car on the computer ready to look up a part <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> NAPA SUCKS. If Autozone did paint I'd never have to go there again.||||reg||14
